  "body": "With a peaceful green outlook, a north-facing deck made for long summer afternoons and views across to Gulf Harbour Marina from upstairs, 29 Kaipuke Crescent delivers the kind of lifestyle that makes coming home a pleasure. Set on a 298sqm freehold section, this modern 171sqm brick and weatherboard home offers spacious, easy-care living for families, first-home buyers or investors looking for a smart addition to their portfolio. Fire up the BBQ, pour a drink and settle in - with the former Gulf Harbour golf course providing an expansive green backdrop, you'll have plenty of reasons to enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* 171sqm brick and weatherboard home\r\n* 298sqm freehold section\r\n* North-facing deck and garden\r\n* Upstairs views down to Gulf Harbour Marina\r\n* Rumpus can be utilised as a living area or fifth bedroom as required\r\n* Peaceful outlook bordering the former Gulf Harbour golf course\r\n* Heat pump and ventilation system for year-round comfort\r\n* Single internal access garage with laundry\r\n* Early childcare centre just down the road\r\n* Close to Wentworth College, Wentworth Primary and Gulf Harbour Primary\r\n\r\nGulf Harbour is all about making the most of the coast. Spend weekends boating from the marina, swimming at nearby beaches, exploring the walking tracks or enjoying a meal at Next Bar & Eatery. With Gulf Harbour Village, cafes, restaurants and Shakespear Regional Park close by, there's plenty to enjoy right on your doorstep. The weekday ferry offers a convenient commute into Auckland CBD, while nearby schools and local amenities make everyday life that little bit easier.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a modern, affordable family home or an easy-care investment in a sought-after coastal location, 29 Kaipuke Crescent is well worth a look.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 26th November (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/ES38\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
